		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1DF34C60DDABA0B6"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#B06BE8 to=#E3C4FF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>品红护身符</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你出生时就已经手持其中一个，颜色是随机的。它放在项链槽位，会提供 </grad><grad from=#FFA5E8 to=#FFFFFF f=0.8>减去25%的重力</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>共有七种颜色。与其他玩家交易是收集其余颜色的唯一理智方法，而且，人们确实会这样做。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#A0A0A0 to=#606060>护身符没有配方。永远都没有。</grad></shadow></shadow>"
			]
