			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#8FB8FF to=#FFFFFF f=0.6>神秘护身符：蓝色</grad></shadow>"
			x: 3.0d
			y: 3.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["18FE872D6A440319"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#C77DFF to=#F0DAFF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>万物所需的那一件物品</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>两条路径，两个大环和半串护身符的列表都从这里开始。如果本章只记住一件事，就记住这个吧。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#B06BE8 to=#E3C4FF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>获取方式</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>刷可疑的沙子或砾石。沙漠金字塔、沙漠水井、冷/暖洋流遗迹和遗迹小径都算，每刷取率为 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>3 %</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>合成一个需要 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>8</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> </grad></shadow><grad from=#D9A5FF to=#B06BE8 f=0.8>大地碎片</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>向流浪商人购买一个碎片，花费 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>1</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 个碎片和 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>20</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 颗绿宝石。这是一笔稀有交易，请持续留意他们。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 考古挖掘一旦触发，会替换掉整个箱子的战利品，所以能给你心脏的刷子，就不会给别的。值得的。"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#B06BE8 to=#E3C4FF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>它会变成什么</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- 在血祭坛上放置一个扭曲之心，用于被诅咒的一侧。"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>净化之心</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>置于自然祭坛上，用于正义一方。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>宝藏猎人护符、狂怒生命精华与生命颂歌。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "5782089F4989B165"
			min_width: 350
			rewards: [{
				id: "1B780E13B0BDC9DD"
				item: "enigmaticlegacy:earth_heart"
				type: "item"
			}]
			shape: "pentagon"
			size: 1.5d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#B06BE8 to=#B06BE8>整个模组的根源。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "20DECD284A73182E"
				item: "enigmaticlegacy:earth_heart"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#C77DFF to=#F0DAFF f=0.6>地球之心</grad></shadow>"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 5.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5782089F4989B165"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#B06BE8 to=#E3C4FF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>可靠的路线</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在末地以下的维度，某个头顶没有天空的地方杀死怪物，它们会掉落碎片，掉落率为 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>3 %</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。每提升一级抢夺，会额外增加 </grad><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>1.5 %</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它们也会出现在主世界地牢的箱子里，每次一两个，只要箱子不在水下就行。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>八个碎片在合成网格中可制作一个地心之心。过程缓慢，但它永不停歇，而且低于零的刷怪塔可以批量产出它们。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "5E6E81DC51548475"
			min_width: 330
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#B06BE8 to=#B06BE8>可种植，与原版不同。</grad></typewriter>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "5E25E09E455F2BC8"
				item: "enigmaticaddons:earth_heart_fragment"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#B6EE86 to=#EAFFD6 f=0.6>大地之碎片</grad></shadow>"
			x: -1.5d
			y: 5.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5782089F4989B165"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#C77DFF to=#F0DAFF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>双环，一世界</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>这是整个模组围绕其构建的分叉。一旦佩戴，两个戒指都无法移除，它们都会改变游戏对你的处理方式，并解锁一个无人能持有的遗物架。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#B06BE8 to=#E3C4FF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>七大诅咒</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF8A8A to=#E03131 f=0.8>痛苦。</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 你承受双倍伤害，中立生物厌恶你，盔甲几乎无效，而且会永久燃烧。作为回报，你获得了夸张的掠夺、夸张的时运、几乎所有原版生物的特殊掉落物，以及用它们制成的遗物。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你的魔法靠的是 </grad><grad from=#FF8A8A to=#E03131 f=0.8>生命之力</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>而不是法力。用完了就会死。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"{ \"text\": \"Open The Seven Curses\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"#FF8A8A\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"3430F8495290E34C\" } }"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#B06BE8 to=#E3C4FF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>七美德</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>纪律。</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 你无法正确使用武器，所有怪物都会优先攻击你，穿戴的护甲越多伤害越低，站在黑暗中还会被冻住。作为交换，你获得了极高的幸运值、超远的攻击距离、宝箱会开出双倍物品，并且永久获得药水效果。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你的魔法依靠世界的</grad><grad from=#B6EE86 to=#5FBF3A f=0.8>自然能量</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>而非法力。将其耗尽，世界会向你复仇。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"{ \"text\": \"Open The Seven Virtues\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"#FFE9A8\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"2482696E9E09D728\" } }"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"[!danger] 切勿同时佩戴。在自作聪明前，先读读两个戒指之间的任务说明。"
			]
			icon: "enigmaticlegacy:enigmatic_eye"
			id: "2C3B2E755434DE67"
			min_width: 360
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.5d
			subtitle: "<typewriter><grad from=#B06BE8 to=#B06BE8>在触碰两者之前，请先阅读两者。</grad>"
			tasks: [{
				id: "52B620B27C0A9F29"
				title: "我理解你的选择，也尊重你的决定。"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#C77DFF to=#F0DAFF f=0.6>你选择哪条路？</grad></shadow>"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 6.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["2C3B2E755434DE67"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#E03131 to=#FFAFAF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>馊主意</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>原版模组中没有此配方，因此本整合包添加了一个。在</grad><grad from=#FF8A8A to=#E03131 f=0.8>Maledictus Pact</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>周围放置暗金属锭，下方放置一个召唤者之球。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!danger] 戴上后是永久性的。之后只有两种方法可以解除，而且两种方法都在本章内。两种方法都不便宜。"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#E03131 to=#FFAFAF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>七重诅咒</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你承受的任何来源的伤害增加 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>200%</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，并且击退也增加 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>200%。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>中立生物会在 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>24</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 格内变为敌对，并能穿过墙壁在 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>4</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 格内找到你。 </grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你的护甲效果降低了 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>65 %</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>怪物受到的来自你的伤害减少。此整合包将此惩罚设为 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>0 百分比</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，所以在这里不起作用。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>当你被点燃时，你将永远燃烧。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每一次死亡都撕裂着你的灵魂。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>无法治愈的失眠。幻象现已成为生活方式。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#E03131 to=#FFAFAF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>七福神</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>+7</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 战利品掠夺。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>+7</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 时运。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>+200 percent</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 怪物经验值。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>+24</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 附魔台上的附魔等级。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>大多数原版生物的独特掉落物。下一个任务会列出所有名称。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你的末地箱始终触手可及，就像末地戒指一样。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你可以持有并使用其他人无法使用的遗迹物品。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#E03131 to=#FFAFAF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>契约的两个变化</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你使用生命之力施放法术，而非法力。若生命之力耗尽，你将当场死亡。</grad></shadow><grad from=#FF8A8A to=#E03131 f=0.8>生命之力</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7></grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>法术冷却和施放时间大幅下降。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它还会打开 </grad><grad from=#FF8A8A to=#E03131 f=0.8>Blasphemy</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 插槽，元素遗物就存放在那里。</grad></shadow>"
			]
