		{
			dependencies: ["2C3B2E755434DE67"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>另一个馊主意</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>黄铜锭围绕着一个 </grad><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>神圣契约</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，下方是一个灵魂翡翠。此整合包编写了该配方，模组本身不包含配方。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!danger] 同样是永久性的。而且只有一个逃生口，需要耐心而不是灵魂水晶才能打开。"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>七重负担</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>武器和工具会与你近战。正确地挥舞它们是不可能的。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>怪物会中断手头的一切来对付你，这对站在你后面的人来说再好不过了。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你的伤害会因护甲点数而降低 </grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>4%</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，没有全套护甲则不造成伤害。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你不得伤害无辜的动物。绝对不行。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一旦你被冰冻，就会一直处于冻结状态。无法解冻。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在绝对的黑暗中，你只会停止移动。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你释放的是世界的</grad></shadow><grad from=#B6EE86 to=#5FBF3A f=0.8>自然能量</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>而非法力，消耗它能让世界与你一同复苏。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#F5C542 to=#FFF4CF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>七美德</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>+7</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 幸运。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>+7</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 方块挖掘范围。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>宝箱会掉落物品，</grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>两次，</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>而不是通常的一次，并且，</grad></shadow><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>四次，</grad><shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>如果你还佩戴着创造者的恩宠。"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>所有好的药水效果都会永久叠加持续时间。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>神圣遗物独有的掉落物。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>神圣召回，随时免费传送到你的出生点。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFC46B to=#FF9E1F f=0.8>60 percent</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> of any spell damage you take gets redirected into the world instead.</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它还会打开 </grad><grad from=#FFE9A8 to=#F5C542 f=0.8>Sacrament</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 插槽，即 Blasphemy 插槽的镜像插槽。</grad></shadow>"
			]
